<tr><td>Reticular veins</td><td><strong class="ex-n">1–3 mm</strong></td><td>較深、較大；blue 或 greenish hue</td></tr>
<tr><td>Varicose veins</td><td><strong class="ex-n">≥4 mm</strong></td><td>Bulging、dilated、tortuous</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p class="ex-cite">p.3877</p>
<h3>CEAP classification（Clinical-Etiologic-Anatomic-Pathophysiologic）</h3>
<p>CEAP 是描述性工具，可能有助於診斷與嚴重度評估。<span class="ex-ref">p.3877</span></p>
